        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Mirador de la Flor, Corpus Christi, Texas\n- People: Selena Quintanilla-Pérez, Yolanda Saldívar\n- Topics: monuments, murder, parole\n\nFacts:\n- Selena Quintanilla-Pérez was murdered in 1995 at the age of 23 by Yolanda Saldívar, her assistant and the head of her fan club.\n- Mirador de la Flor is a monument in Corpus Christi, Texas, and it was unveiled in 1997 to honor Selena Quintanilla-Pérez.\n- Yolanda Saldívar will be eligible for parole on March 30, 2025.",
